    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da3d50933be5b6476c5c195",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………嗯，没错。\n原来是这么一回事。\n为什么我一直没发现呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9979b21344deac9c644c00cd747658994ba9d26e82ab2e0e253095544ac640f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d015e9e82bc3ac1b1e05e7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……北港火山刚来到训练员室，\n醒目飞鹰就这样向她提议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db9aa215f102e5664786d3cf0c1889e22bc0c311a6eab2275caf316a9c46930a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
