    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945c893d309b88fb5a2baae8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我汇集了苫小牧令人自豪的部分，\n只顾着向别人传达……\n苫小牧是个很好、很厉害的地方──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2173e26684c1d340ffe982238fd95283d0548ea185626d2f90f7a33068151be1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f7462f21fac94554eabe958",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏北港火山，\n我现在有自信说自己对苫小牧这座城市的\n优点了若指掌。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "585151ce5081e28caa0e1e49d715d7a582e4a24eb24fddbc7661d1189197fad1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
