    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d1067e73a7214678f5ffd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山这段时间努力\n掌握到的那些粉丝的关注，\n一定还能变换成各种形式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe4b44e1d4830e1f3713d8594eac87fca85644d91f94c5baf9e17bb47c839d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099116.json",
      "json_path": [
